<title>AUSTRALIA: Budget eases pressure on Australia rates - Howard.</title>
<headline>Budget eases pressure on Australia rates - Howard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Thursday the government's latest budget would take massive pressure off interest rates.  </p>
<p>Howard said in a television interview the budget for the fiscal year starting July 1 would help small business by taking pressure off rates.</p>
<p>&quot;They have been given a budget that reduces debt and therefore takes massive pressure off interest rates,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
